Z||000010||DecadenceR||08-28-2001||06:37 PM||||I told you to stop eating the ice cream on duty....<BR>But JSocha is 100% right. They HAVE to give you copies of your paperwork on your request, they do have to tell you why you are being let go as well. <P>And no, toys r us is NOT fun to work for.i was a department manager there until June. Think of it as a job where you get paid to pick up for little hell-beasts all day.....||||reg||1
